title: Counterrevolutionary Plot Uncovered! 
new-page: true
view-if: cheka_founded = 1 and ca_disbanded = 1 and month = 1 and week = 4
max-visits: 1
tags: event

= Counterrevolutionary Plot

According to the Cheka, a conspiracy seeking to overthrow soviet power has been uncovered in Petrograd! The plot appears to have emerged among those dissatisfied with the dissolution of the Constituent Assembly, and was seeking to mobilize several thousand soldiers to their cause, possibly with foreign backing. 

We've already arrested suspected members of the plot. The Cheka is requesting that militias in the city be placed on high alert, and that we dedicate additional resources toward rooting out the conspiracy fully. 


- @accept
- @reject


@accept
title: Give the Cheka free rein to persecute this conspiracy, and grant them the resources they need to do so. 
on-arrival: {!
    Q.instability += 1; 
    Q.cheka += 4; Q.cheka_strength += 6; Q.cheka_militancy += 0.2; Q.cheka_loyality += 0.1;
    Q.internal_expend += 0.25; 
    Q.crime -= 5; 
    Q.intelligentsia_unrest += 2; Q.elite_unrest += 4; 
!}

The Cheka increases its counterevolutionary efforts, and begins forming sub-committees in the city's districts.
  
@reject
title: Wrap up the investigation promptly, we can't afford a major expansion right now. 
on-arrival: {!
    Q.instability -= 1; 
    Q.cheka_militancy -= 0.1; Q.cheka_loyality -= 0.05;
!}

The Cheka carries out the investigation and imprisons the leading conspirators, then returns back to its normal business. 
